<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Solar installation in Ibadan usually starts with the same story: an IBEDC bill, a gen drinking petrol, and light that comes and goes. This page is for households and small businesses in Bodija, Akobo, Jericho, Oluyole, Challenge, Ring Road and the areas around them who want to know what to ask before paying anyone. Harmattan Solar Co is an advertising site, so the work itself is done by an independent installer who quotes your job.</p><p>If you live in a bungalow, the roof is usually yours alone, which makes panel placement simpler than on a shared roof. The honest way to buy is to collect two or three written quotes that list the exact inverter, battery and panel models, then compare them line by line. Call now on +234 809 000 0000 and describe what you want to run.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Do in Ibadan</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">Services for Ibadan Properties</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Home solar installation</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Hybrid systems for Ibadan bungalows, duplexes and flats, sized from a load audit of your own appliances. Roof space on a bungalow is usually the easy part; the sizing is where quotes differ.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Inverter and battery installation</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">For Ibadan households whose tubular batteries no longer last the night, or who want to move to lithium. Ask each installer to name the battery model and its manufacturer-stated cycle claim in writing.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Commercial solar</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">For shops, schools, clinics, churches and small offices in Ibadan trying to cut diesel and NEPA bills. A sensible quote starts from your fuel spend, your running hours and the loads that must not drop.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Solar and inverter repair</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">For Ibadan systems that keep tripping, beeping or going flat early. An independent installer checks the DB, changeover, earthing, protection and battery health before anyone suggests replacing parts.</p>
      </div>
</div>
